# These get COPY'd into and executed inside Linux containers (see the
# Dockerfiles under backend/, app/, fetcher/ and Dockerfile.tests). A CRLF
# checkout - the default core.autocrlf=true behaviour on Windows - breaks a
# shebang line and any multi-line RUN command that embeds one, so force LF
# regardless of what the checking-out machine's git config says.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile.* text eol=lf
